msgid ""
"**Note:** These instructions concern the older Qubes builder (v1). It "
"supports only building Qubes 4.2 or earlier.The build process has been "
"completely rewritten in `qubes-builder v2 <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-"
"builderv2/>`__      . This can be used for building Qubes R4.2 and later, "
"and all related components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/building/qubes-builder.rst:12
#: 2441d574d9cb43bf968b3b218822fd92
msgid ""
"**Note: See** :doc:`ISO building instructions </developer/building/qubes-iso-"
